摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness plugin for Antigravity OAuth login and native Antigravity Auth capability bundle","id":"gh:1341349497","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-antigravity-auth","slug":"suntianc/dsh-antigravity-auth","topics":["antigravity","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","gemini","oauth"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness plugin for Antigravity OAuth login and native Antigravity Auth capability bundle"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-antigravity-auth"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Use your Antigravity account in DeepSeek Harness (DSH) for language models, web search, image creati"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"on, and experimental video understanding. One shared login also powers the usage dashboard. Cache mu"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ltiple accounts locally and switch between them manually, with **one active account at a time**."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> **Unofficial, experimental, personal use only.** Google does not support third-party Antigravity l"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ogin tools; your account may be suspended or terminated. Read the Google FAQ and Additional Terms be"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"fore signing in. Private endpoints can change or stop working without notice. Do not rely on this pl"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"ugin for production workloads."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**Current release:** `0.1.5` (`latest`). See Releases and CHANGELOG for version history."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Quick start · Using the capabilities · Account commands · Troubleshooting · Development"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## What it provides"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Capability | DSH entry point |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Language models | `google-antigravity` provider in the model selector, with Gemini, Claude, and GP"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"T-OSS routes subject to account availability |\n| Web search | `antigravity` search provider for the "},{"id":"p10s3","text":"stock `web_search` tool |\n| Image generation and editing | `generate_image`, plus `list_images` for "},{"id":"p10s4","text":"saved session images |\n| Experimental video understanding | `analyze_video` for MP4 files in the act"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"ive workspace |\n| Account and quota status | **Settings → Antigravity**, with five-hour and weekly q"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"uota windows and English/Chinese UI |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### 1. Check requirements"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- A working DSH installation. The tested development baseline is **DSH `0.2.1-rc.5`**.\n- Node.js `^2"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"2.19.0` or `>=24.0.0`, and `pnpm` on `PATH` (`11.7.0` is the project's tested version).\n- A Google a"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"ccount with Antigravity access.\n- A local Host and browser for OAuth. Web account actions require th"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"e Host's WebServer to be explicitly bound to **`127.0.0.1`**; the temporary OAuth callback uses **`1"},{"id":"p13s5","text":" to be explicitly bound to **`127.0.0.1`**; the temporary OAuth callback uses **`127.0.0.1:51121`**."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The package does not restrict the DSH peer version range. That allows installation on other versions"},{"id":"p14s2","text":", but does **not** establish compatibility. See the verification scope."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### 2. Install or upgrade"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Stop the Host using the target profile, then run:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Replace `web` with your actual profile, such as `desktop`. Confirm the listed version, restart that "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"Host (for the Web profile, `dsh web`), and refresh the client."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### 3. Sign in"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"1. Open **Settings → Antigravity** and choose **Start Antigravity login**. Starting login records ac"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"knowledgement of the unofficial-channel risk above.\n2. Complete Google authorization in the browser "},{"id":"p20s3","text":"on the Host machine. If the new tab is blocked, use **Open the Google authorization page** in the se"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"ttings card.\n3. Return to DSH and check the login result. Run `/anti status` for detailed capability"},{"id":"p20s5","text":" status. If authorization expires, cancel it or start a new login.\n4. Select an available `google-an"},{"id":"p20s6","text":"tigravity` model. In the Antigravity settings cards, enable the Search, Image, or Video capabilities"},{"id":"p20s7","text":" In the Antigravity settings cards, enable the Search, Image, or Video capabilities you want to use."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Login and a usable project are required. The normal Host automatically activates capability gates fo"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"r the account; this is **not a live test of every model or tool**. Actual availability still depends"},{"id":"p21s3","text":" on the account and private backend. A disabled control also needs a writable Host settings scope."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"For terminal login, see Account commands."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Using the capabilities"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- **Models:** choose `google-antigravity` in DSH's model selector. The plugin also registers `google"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"` as an alias when no other provider owns it. Live discovery filters the pinned model catalog; if di"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"scovery is temporarily unavailable, the selector may show an advisory snapshot rather than confirmed"},{"id":"p24s4","text":" availability.\n- **Search:** select `antigravity` in the Host's **Web Search** provider configuratio"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"n when multiple providers are installed. Enabling the Antigravity card alone does not replace DSH's "},{"id":"p24s6","text":"selected provider. The stock `web_search` tool then returns grounded results with source links.\n- **"},{"id":"p24s7","text":"Images:** ask DSH to generate an image, or edit an explicit session image (`image:<id>`) or workspac"},{"id":"p24s8","text":"e image. `generate_image` accepts a prompt, up to **5 references**, an optional model, and requests "},{"id":"p24s9","text":"for **1–4 images** (`n`). Partial success can return fewer images with warnings. Images are saved as"},{"id":"p24s10","text":" session attachments and can be found with `list_images`. Dedicated size, aspect-ratio, quality, and"},{"id":"p24s11","text":" transparency parameters are not implemented.\n- **Video:** provide an explicit MP4 path inside the a"},{"id":"p24s12","text":"ctive workspace and a question for `analyze_video`. The default and maximum file limit is **32 MiB**"},{"id":"p24s13","text":". Remote URLs, paths outside the workspace, and symlinks are rejected. The tool sends the MP4 to the"},{"id":"p24s14","text":" private endpoint; it does not implement local frame sampling. This is an experimental POC, not a gu"},{"id":"p24s15","text":"arantee of full video, audio, or timeline understanding.\n- **Quota:** check the Antigravity settings"},{"id":"p24s16","text":" dashboard for remaining five-hour/weekly limits and reset times. Unavailable or rate-limited quota "},{"id":"p24s17","text":"data is shown as a status, not treated as zero usage."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Account commands"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"On interactive DSH surfaces that support slash commands, `/anti` is an alias for `/antigravity-auth`"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"n interactive DSH surfaces that support slash commands, `/anti` is an alias for `/antigravity-auth`:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Security and scope"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- OAuth uses PKCE S256 and a temporary loopback-only callback. Tokens stay on the Host and are not e"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"xposed to the browser, settings, logs, or tool metadata.\n- Local account files contain refresh token"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"s. Protect them: POSIX storage uses owner-only permissions; Windows uses user-data ACLs. Do not shar"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"e `auth.json`, `accounts.json`, authorization/callback URLs, or raw media payloads in bug reports.\n-"},{"id":"p30s5","text":" Refresh, switch, logout, and revoke operations remain bound to the account that started them, so de"},{"id":"p30s6","text":"layed work cannot overwrite a different active account.\n- Private requests use fixed approved endpoi"},{"id":"p30s7","text":"nts and retain truthful DSH attribution through `X-DeepSeek-Harness-Attribution`. This is transport "},{"id":"p30s8","text":"compatibility, not protection from account restrictions.\n- The plugin uses public DSH extension inte"},{"id":"p30s9","text":"rfaces. It does not replace DSH core, offer automatic account rotation, or provide production suppor"},{"id":"p30s10","text":"aces. It does not replace DSH core, offer automatic account rotation, or provide production support."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
